{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
Just in case you want maximized windows to work properly:

1. Set 'hide_maximized' to 'false' in your
   ~/.config/xfce4-sweaters/config.json file.
2. Open 'xfwm4-tweaks-settings' and uncheck the
   "Hide frame of windows when maximized" option in the Accessibility section.
3. Open 'xfwm4-workspace-settings' and adjust the margins in the Margins
   section.

Remember that this project requires the compositor to be enabled.
EOM
}
